{"parse":{"title":"极限解放/破晓的号角","pageid":6385,"revid":15521,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E7%A0%B4%E6%99%93%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%B7%E8%A7%92&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E7%A0%B4%E6%99%93%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%B7%E8%A7%92&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E7%A0%B4%E6%99%93%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%B7%E8%A7%92&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>破晓的号角</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.A0.B4.E6.99.93.E7.9A.84.E5.8F.B7.E8.A7.92\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"破晓的号角\"><b>破晓的号角</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">极限解放详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"3\"><img alt=\"极限解放 破晓的号角.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c3/cry2da29bbohieug2p5hnp6ol84c9hm.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E7%A0%B4%E6%99%93%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%B7%E8%A7%92.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c3/cry2da29bbohieug2p5hnp6ol84c9hm.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E7%A0%B4%E6%99%93%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%B7%E8%A7%92.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c3/cry2da29bbohieug2p5hnp6ol84c9hm.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />破晓的号角\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">暗影刺客</span>]攻击提高一定百分比（阿坎贝基础攻击的<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>）<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">暗影刺客</span>]获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">同袍同泽1</span>]，效果：被范围攻击或被击败时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">阿坎贝</span>]获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">阿坎贝</span>]每回合最多获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次本效果。<br />✦行动开始时，若[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">阿坎贝</span>]的技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">暗影刺客</font></span>]处于冷却中，且拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]，则消耗10层并冷却回合减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">暗影刺客</span>]攻击提高一定百分比（阿坎贝基础攻击的<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>）<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">暗影刺客</span>]获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">同袍同泽2</span>]，效果：被范围攻击或被击败时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">阿坎贝</span>]获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">阿坎贝</span>]每回合最多获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次本效果；释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">杀戮之刃</font></span>]时，会对范围内已方召唤角色造成生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]。<br />✦行动开始时，若[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">阿坎贝</span>]的技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">暗影刺客</font></span>]处于冷却中，且拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]，则消耗10层并冷却回合减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">暗影刺客</span>]攻击提高一定百分比（阿坎贝基础攻击的<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>）<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">暗影刺客</span>]获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">同袍同泽3</span>]，效果：被范围攻击或被击败时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">阿坎贝</span>]获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]、回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">阿坎贝</span>]每回合最多获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次本效果；释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">杀戮之刃</font></span>]时，会对范围内已方召唤角色造成生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]。<br />✦行动开始时，若[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">阿坎贝</span>]的技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">暗影刺客</font></span>]处于冷却中，且拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">10</font>层及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]，则消耗10层并冷却回合减少<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"决意之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/40px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/60px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndcjm7uvo1f3yh9srgdjsl3buxacbvp.png/80px-%E5%86%B3%E6%84%8F%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"决意之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/04/ndc